## UI Pro Max Search Results
**Domain:** web | **Query:** responsive form layout
**Source:** app-interface.csv | **Found:** 2 results

### Result 1
- **Category:** Typography
- **Issue:** Dynamic Type Support
- **Platform:** iOS/Android/React Native
- **Description:** Support system text scaling without breaking layout
- **Do:** Set allowFontScaling and test large text
- **Don't:** Disable scaling on all text globally
- **Code Example Good:** <Text allowFontScaling>{label}</Text>
- **Code Example Bad:** <Text allowFontScaling={false}>{label}</Text>
- **Severity:** High

### Result 2
- **Category:** Accessibility
- **Issue:** Form Control Labels
- **Platform:** iOS/Android/React Native
- **Description:** All inputs must have a visible label and an accessibility label
- **Do:** Pair Text label with input and set accessibilityLabel
- **Don't:** Inputs with placeholder only
- **Code Example Good:** <View><Text>Email</Text><TextInput accessibilityLabel="Email address" /></View>
- **Code Example Bad:** <TextInput placeholder="Email" /></View>
- **Severity:** Critical

